### 1. Login (saves the token automatically)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jlawson0926",
  "password": "TestPass1!"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. No token, should be 401/403
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users

### 3. With token, should be 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create user, should be 201 with temporary_password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "email_address": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "role": "ACCOUNTANT",
  "security_question1": "Mothers Maiden Name?",
  "security_question2": "Favorite Sports Team?",
  "security_question3": "Name of childhood pet?",
  "security_answer1": "Janie",
  "security_answer2": "The Horde",
  "security_answer3": "Tauren"
}

### 5. Same email again, should be 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Jane",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "email_address": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "role": "ACCOUNTANT"
}

### 6. Suspend with a bad range, should be 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suspension_start": "2026-10-20",
  "suspension_end": "2026-10-10"
}

### 7. Suspend with a valid range, status becomes SUSPENDED
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "suspension_start": "2026-10-10",
  "suspension_end": "2026-10-20"
}

### 8. Activate again
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Nonexistent user, should be 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Expired passwords report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/reports/expired-passwords
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

